---
config:
  themeVariables:
    noteBkgColor: "#f7f7f7"
    noteTextColor: "#333333"
    noteBorderColor: "#999999"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Staff member
    participant B as Browser (React app)
    participant L as Laravel API
    participant D as MySQL
    participant K as EventClassifier
    S->>B: Choose "Done" in the task's status menu
    B->>L: PATCH /api/tasks/{id}/status + token
    L->>D: Mark finished events completed, look up the token and the task
    D-->>L: Task and its event
    alt Not the task's owner (and not an Officer or Administrator)
        L-->>B: 403 "You can only update your own tasks."
        B-->>S: Error message
    else The event is completed (and the user is not the Administrator)
        L-->>B: 403 "This event is completed..."
        B-->>S: Error message
    else Allowed
        L->>D: Save the new status
        L-->>B: The updated task
        B-->>S: "Task marked as Done."
        B->>L: Reload the event or the task list
        L->>D: Read the event and its tasks
        D-->>L: Event and tasks
        L->>K: Classify the event's readiness
        K-->>L: Label and reason, e.g. On Track, "All tasks done"
        L-->>B: JSON
        B-->>S: Updated progress and readiness label
    end
